{"page":265,"width":1695,"height":2351,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"이진 트리 순회 애를릿을 이용하여 다음의 실험을 수행하라.","words":[{"text":"이진","x":184,"y":233,"width":41,"height":26},{"text":"트리","x":234,"y":232,"width":42,"height":25},{"text":"순회","x":285,"y":232,"width":42,"height":25},{"text":"애를릿을","x":336,"y":231,"width":84,"height":25},{"text":"이용하여","x":429,"y":230,"width":81,"height":26},{"text":"다음의","x":520,"y":230,"width":60,"height":26},{"text":"실험을","x":589,"y":229,"width":62,"height":26},{"text":"수행하라.","x":658,"y":230,"width":88,"height":25}]},{"text":"가상 실습 8.1","words":[{"text":"가상","x":1369,"y":192,"width":42,"height":25},{"text":"실습","x":1418,"y":192,"width":43,"height":24},{"text":"8.1","x":1468,"y":193,"width":26,"height":23}]},{"text":"이진 트리 순회","words":[{"text":"이진","x":1373,"y":241,"width":42,"height":25},{"text":"트리","x":1423,"y":241,"width":41,"height":25},{"text":"순회","x":1473,"y":241,"width":43,"height":26}]},{"text":"(1) 숫자를 직접 입력하여 이진 탐색 트리를 만들어보고 이진 탐색 트리를 중위 순회로 순회하면 정렬된 결과가 얻어지","words":[{"text":"(1)","x":175,"y":1048,"width":25,"height":27},{"text":"숫자를","x":208,"y":1049,"width":65,"height":25},{"text":"직접","x":281,"y":1049,"width":42,"height":25},{"text":"입력하여","x":333,"y":1049,"width":85,"height":25},{"text":"이진","x":428,"y":1049,"width":41,"height":25},{"text":"탐색","x":479,"y":1049,"width":40,"height":25},{"text":"트리를","x":528,"y":1049,"width":63,"height":24},{"text":"만들어보고","x":600,"y":1048,"width":103,"height":25},{"text":"이진","x":712,"y":1048,"width":40,"height":24},{"text":"탐색","x":761,"y":1048,"width":40,"height":25},{"text":"트리를","x":809,"y":1048,"width":65,"height":25},{"text":"중위","x":881,"y":1049,"width":41,"height":25},{"text":"순회로","x":930,"y":1049,"width":67,"height":25},{"text":"순회하면","x":1003,"y":1050,"width":85,"height":25},{"text":"정렬된","x":1098,"y":1049,"width":62,"height":26},{"text":"결과가","x":1170,"y":1048,"width":65,"height":26},{"text":"얻어지","x":1242,"y":1048,"width":65,"height":26}]},{"text":"는 것을 확인하라.","words":[{"text":"는","x":208,"y":1093,"width":22,"height":24},{"text":"것을","x":238,"y":1093,"width":43,"height":24},{"text":"확인하라.","x":289,"y":1093,"width":92,"height":25}]},{"text":"(기 중위, 전위, 후위 순회가 진행되면서 순환호출이 어떻게 일어나는지를 관찰하라. 동시에 순환 호출되는 함수의 매","words":[{"text":"(기","x":176,"y":1136,"width":24,"height":26},{"text":"중위,","x":208,"y":1136,"width":49,"height":27},{"text":"전위,","x":268,"y":1137,"width":48,"height":26},{"text":"후위","x":326,"y":1136,"width":42,"height":25},{"text":"순회가","x":379,"y":1136,"width":65,"height":25},{"text":"진행되면서","x":453,"y":1136,"width":106,"height":26},{"text":"순환호출이","x":568,"y":1135,"width":104,"height":26},{"text":"어떻게","x":683,"y":1135,"width":61,"height":25},{"text":"일어나는지를","x":755,"y":1135,"width":126,"height":26},{"text":"관찰하라.","x":890,"y":1136,"width":92,"height":26},{"text":"동시에","x":991,"y":1138,"width":64,"height":25},{"text":"순환","x":1065,"y":1137,"width":44,"height":26},{"text":"호출되는","x":1116,"y":1137,"width":87,"height":25},{"text":"함수의","x":1213,"y":1136,"width":63,"height":25},{"text":"매","x":1287,"y":1136,"width":19,"height":24}]},{"text":"개변수를 기록하라.","words":[{"text":"개변수를","x":210,"y":1181,"width":85,"height":24},{"text":"기록하라.","x":305,"y":1180,"width":91,"height":25}]},{"text":"전위, 중위, 후위 순회 구현","words":[{"text":"전위,","x":145,"y":1353,"width":77,"height":41},{"text":"중위,","x":236,"y":1352,"width":77,"height":42},{"text":"후위","x":327,"y":1351,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"순회","x":406,"y":1352,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"구현","x":486,"y":1352,"width":66,"height":38}]},{"text":"3가지의 표준적인 순회 방법을 C언어 함수로 구현하여 보자. 함수의 매개변수는 루트를 가리키","words":[{"text":"3가지의","x":145,"y":1421,"width":94,"height":30},{"text":"표준적인","x":254,"y":1421,"width":107,"height":29},{"text":"순회","x":373,"y":1420,"width":52,"height":31},{"text":"방법을","x":439,"y":1421,"width":81,"height":31},{"text":"C언어","x":531,"y":1422,"width":69,"height":30},{"text":"함수로","x":614,"y":1423,"width":79,"height":30},{"text":"구현하여","x":703,"y":1424,"width":104,"height":30},{"text":"보자.","x":820,"y":1424,"width":61,"height":31},{"text":"함수의","x":895,"y":1424,"width":78,"height":32},{"text":"매개변수는","x":987,"y":1425,"width":135,"height":30},{"text":"루트를","x":1131,"y":1426,"width":85,"height":29},{"text":"가리키","x":1227,"y":1425,"width":80,"height":31}]},{"text":"는 포인터가 된다. 먼저 표준적인 순회방법이 순환적으로 정의되어 있다는 것에 직만하여야 한","words":[{"text":"는","x":144,"y":1474,"width":29,"height":28},{"text":"포인터가","x":184,"y":1473,"width":110,"height":31},{"text":"된다.","x":306,"y":1473,"width":60,"height":30},{"text":"먼저","x":382,"y":1473,"width":51,"height":31},{"text":"표준적인","x":448,"y":1474,"width":107,"height":29},{"text":"순회방법이","x":567,"y":1474,"width":129,"height":31},{"text":"순환적으로","x":710,"y":1476,"width":134,"height":31},{"text":"정의되어","x":857,"y":1477,"width":103,"height":31},{"text":"있다는","x":976,"y":1477,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"것에","x":1068,"y":1478,"width":50,"height":30},{"text":"직만하여야","x":1132,"y":1478,"width":139,"height":31},{"text":"한","x":1282,"y":1479,"width":30,"height":30}]},{"text":"다. 왼쪽이나 오른쪽 서브트리를 방문하는 것은, 전체 트리를 방문하는 거나 다를 바가 없다. 즉","words":[{"text":"다.","x":146,"y":1525,"width":32,"height":29},{"text":"왼쪽이나","x":194,"y":1525,"width":109,"height":30},{"text":"오른쪽","x":313,"y":1526,"width":82,"height":28},{"text":"서브트리를","x":406,"y":1526,"width":136,"height":30},{"text":"방문하는","x":552,"y":1526,"width":106,"height":31},{"text":"것은,","x":668,"y":1527,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"전체","x":742,"y":1528,"width":49,"height":31},{"text":"트리를","x":803,"y":1529,"width":82,"height":31},{"text":"방문하는","x":894,"y":1530,"width":108,"height":30},{"text":"거나","x":1012,"y":1530,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"다를","x":1076,"y":1530,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"바가","x":1140,"y":1530,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"없다.","x":1207,"y":1531,"width":61,"height":31},{"text":"즉","x":1282,"y":1533,"width":29,"height":29}]},{"text":"전체 트리를 방문 함수를 다시 한 번 호출해주면 되는 것이다. 다만 다른 점은 함수의 매개변수","words":[{"text":"전체","x":146,"y":1576,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"트리를","x":211,"y":1577,"width":84,"height":29},{"text":"방문","x":305,"y":1577,"width":55,"height":30},{"text":"함수를","x":370,"y":1577,"width":83,"height":31},{"text":"다시","x":464,"y":1578,"width":51,"height":31},{"text":"한","x":529,"y":1578,"width":28,"height":30},{"text":"번","x":568,"y":1579,"width":25,"height":29},{"text":"호출해주면","x":604,"y":1579,"width":132,"height":31},{"text":"되는","x":748,"y":1581,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"것이다.","x":813,"y":1582,"width":84,"height":31},{"text":"다만","x":913,"y":1582,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"다른","x":976,"y":1582,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"점은","x":1040,"y":1582,"width":54,"height":29},{"text":"함수의","x":1105,"y":1582,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"매개변수","x":1198,"y":1583,"width":114,"height":32}]},{"text":"가 달라지게 된다. 즉 서브트리를 방문하는 경우에는 서브트리의 루트 노드 포인터를 함수의 매","words":[{"text":"가","x":147,"y":1628,"width":27,"height":31},{"text":"달라지게","x":184,"y":1629,"width":108,"height":30},{"text":"된다.","x":306,"y":1629,"width":60,"height":31},{"text":"즉","x":380,"y":1631,"width":29,"height":29},{"text":"서브트리를","x":419,"y":1631,"width":136,"height":30},{"text":"방문하는","x":565,"y":1631,"width":106,"height":31},{"text":"경우에는","x":682,"y":1632,"width":106,"height":31},{"text":"서브트리의","x":798,"y":1633,"width":129,"height":31},{"text":"루트","x":940,"y":1636,"width":53,"height":28},{"text":"노드","x":1002,"y":1637,"width":55,"height":22},{"text":"포인터를","x":1067,"y":1634,"width":110,"height":30},{"text":"함수의","x":1187,"y":1635,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"매","x":1283,"y":1636,"width":25,"height":31}]},{"text":"개변수로 전달하면 된다. 만약 순환의 개님을 사용하지 않는다면 순회 함수의 구현은 아주 어렵","words":[{"text":"개변수로","x":148,"y":1681,"width":108,"height":31},{"text":"전달하면","x":269,"y":1682,"width":108,"height":31},{"text":"된다.","x":389,"y":1683,"width":61,"height":30},{"text":"만약","x":464,"y":1683,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"순환의","x":528,"y":1683,"width":78,"height":31},{"text":"개님을","x":620,"y":1684,"width":79,"height":30},{"text":"사용하지","x":708,"y":1